	(text "Block C: -2.8 V inverting converter (U3 LT8330, dual-inductor topology)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 73.66 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "36c740e0-81ad-426d-818f-8f27be43a22f"))
	(text "L3/L4, CDC and D1 form the inverting stage. The divider R3/R4 sets VOUT = -0.8 V x (1 + R3/R4) = -2.79 V. EN/UVLO is tied to +3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 73.66 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7b2eec2f-6e6f-44c1-a7a9-4d98131c9352"))
	(text "VIN must stay above 3.0 V (LT8330 minimum). SW swings between 0 V and VIN + |VOUT| = 6.1 V. Output passes JP3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 73.66 207.01 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e44fe77c-986d-42e3-a12d-e06f6dd7e209"))
